title\":{\"text\":\"jackass: best and last\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"Johnny Knoxville and the gang return for one final fling at the big screen. Featuring all-new stunts and stupidity along with the greatest hits and biggest laughs from the past, jackass: best and last is a joyously raucous celebration of all the mischievous camaraderie that you’ve come to love and expect from these idiots over the past 25 years. So, grab your dumb little buddies, raise your glasses, and come experience the cinematic event that promises to be the last time you’ll ever laugh this hard in a theatre.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"Johnny Knoxville and the gang return for one final fling at the big screen. Featuring all-new stunts and stupidity along with the greatest hits and biggest laughs.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000005\",\"censorRatingNote\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-06-26\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":92,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=erztPGWNkY4\",\"displayPriority\":7,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002327\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002329\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002330\",\"roles\":[\"Director\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000018944\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000018945\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000018946\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000018947\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"3163\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"3164\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"3165\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"3167\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"3178\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"3195\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000006\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"434e102b-e02e-431e-aff7-3ea7cd362f6b\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00008914\",\"hoCode\":\"A000010056\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"Paramount Pictures\"},{\"id\":\"HO00008964\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Evil Dead Burn\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"Evil Dead Burn unleashes the franchise’s most savage and terrifying ride to date, blazing onto big screens with an all-new chapter of carnage and demonic mayhem. After the loss of her husband, a woman seeks solace with her in-laws in their secluded family home. As one by one they are transformed into Deadites—turning the gathering into a family reunion from hell—she comes to discover that the vows she took in life... live on even in death.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"Evil Dead Burn unleashes the franchise’s most savage and terrifying ride to date, blazing onto big screens with an all-new chapter of carnage and demonic mayhem. \",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000005\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"strong bloody violence, gore\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2026-07-09\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":109,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YYkUkyfjUKg\",\"displayPriority\":4,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000008177\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000009258\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000019021\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000019022\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000019023\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000019024\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000303\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000014\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"3c50ff95-67b2-4152-9965-ad2431794116\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00008964\",\"hoCode\":\"A000010114\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"STUDIOCANAL\"},{\"id\":\"HO00009072\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"The Invite\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"Joe 